OL,3,GNEWSAThe rise of new black spaces in
OL,4,Amusic
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new sound is taking Bristol's
OL,7,Fdancefloors by storm.
OL,9,FDriven by rolling log drums, syncopated
OL,10,Frhythms and infectious melodies,
OL,11,Famapiano and other electronic sounds
OL,12,Ffrom across the African diaspora are
OL,13,Ffinding new audiences in a city
OL,14,Fcelebrated for its musical heritage.
OL,16,FBehind these parties is a new
OL,17,Fgeneration of black promoters
OL,18,Fpassionate about creating spaces where
OL,19,Fblack people can hear their music,
OL,20,Fcelebrate their cultures and feel like
OL,21,Fthey belong.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
